From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ad5xrecon <ad5xrecon@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] tests: follow the AD5X patches that changed tested behaviour

0035 put the Toolhead tile in the Motion slot of the AD5X home seed, and
0036 replaced the Print Status printer picture with stat tiles and the
IFS; neither updated the tests. The AD5X seed test now expects Toolhead
at col 8, row 6 (2x2) with Motion disabled, and the shipped-seed audit
lets the AD5X seed name toolhead. The cases about the picture's pinned
chips, glows and leader lines are hidden ([.][ad5x_no_picture]); three
new cases check the stat tiles, a stat's text and the IFS part hiding
without an IFS.

Also: 0023 drops the LED suggestion (the validator tests expect none),
0033's language list has no French and adds Turkish (the index tests and
the fixture's language reset use its order), and 0027's grams under a
linked slot cost the 480x272 8-lane tray 2 px, so that case is hidden
([.][ad5x_slot_grams]); the AD5X is 800x480 with 4 slots.

With these the unit sweep fails only what plain beta.17 fails on the
same machine (backlight, screensaver, wifi_saved_config).
